{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Spaceship Down</i>, you play as Noah, an unlucky junior tech stranded on the derelict ship <i>Clementine</i> after a catastrophic crash. Severely injured, you must use every scrap, tool, and clever workaround to navigate the wreckage, rigging makeshift repairs in a desperate bid for survival. Guided by a witty narrator and a chipper AI, <i>AURA</i>, your journey is part escape room, part space mystery, with challenges that balance humour and tension. Solve puzzles, piece together the ship\u2019s secrets, and try to stay alive\u2014before the <i>Clementine</i> decides you\u2019re just another bit of space junk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely explorable ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of easter eggs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story driven gameplay\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3216770?t=1748844074","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748844074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216770/735237370977c29fabdf79c23165d3b3b65330d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748844074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216770/735237370977c29fabdf79c23165d3b3b65330d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748844074","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3771820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Spaceship Down</i>, you play as Noah, an unlucky junior tech stranded on the derelict ship <i>Clementine</i> after a catastrophic crash. Severely injured, you must use every scrap, tool, and clever workaround to navig